							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div style="overflow: auto; width: 100%;">So what are ya&#039;ll looking forward to coming out?  Here&#039;s some I&#039;m interested in.<br /><br /><object width="425" height="350"><param name="movie" value="http://www.youtube.com/v/PfR62ijVnmU"></param><param name="wmode" value="tramsparent"><embed src="http://www.youtube.com/v/PfR62ijVnmU" type="application/x-shockwave-flash" wmode="transparent" width="425" height="350"></embed></object><br />Balls of Fury<br /><br /><object width="425" height="350"><param name="movie" value="http://www.youtube.com/v/Y9W9Z4yMoFw"></param><param name="wmode" value="tramsparent"><embed src="http://www.youtube.com/v/Y9W9Z4yMoFw" type="application/x-shockwave-flash" wmode="transparent" width="425" height="350"></embed></object><br />Rush Hour 3<br /><br /><object width="425" height="350"><param name="movie" value="http://www.youtube.com/v/eOesGgsjFY8"></param><param name="wmode" value="tramsparent"><embed src="http://www.youtube.com/v/eOesGgsjFY8" type="application/x-shockwave-flash" wmode="transparent" width="425" height="350"></embed></object><br />Day Watch- if you haven&#039;t seen Night Watch and Day Watch, you should rent Night Watch, and see this when it comes out (I&#039;ve already seen both, but still).  Serioulsy dope Russian goth/fantasy flicks.  And they&#039;re part 1 and 2 of a trilogy, part 3 hasn&#039;t come out yet.<br /><br /><object width="425" height="350"><param name="movie" value="http://www.youtube.com/v/LxGKe0VpGcQ"></param><param name="wmode" value="tramsparent"><embed src="http://www.youtube.com/v/LxGKe0VpGcQ" type="application/x-shockwave-flash" wmode="transparent" width="425" height="350"></embed></object><br />I Now Pronounce You Chuck and Larry<br /><br /><object width="425" height="350"><param name="movie" value="http://www.youtube.com/v/4BrzBmKQCPw"></param><param name="wmode" value="tramsparent"><embed src="http://www.youtube.com/v/4BrzBmKQCPw" type="application/x-shockwave-flash" wmode="transparent" width="425" height="350"></embed></object><br />Ocean&#039;s 13<br /><br /><object width="425" height="350"><param name="movie" value="http://www.youtube.com/v/WNZwrgFo3GE"></param><param name="wmode" value="tramsparent"><embed src="http://www.youtube.com/v/WNZwrgFo3GE" type="application/x-shockwave-flash" wmode="transparent" width="425" height="350"></embed></object><br />Sunshine<br /><br /><object width="425" height="350"><param name="movie" value="http://www.youtube.com/v/xbVtMY-svzA"></param><param name="wmode" value="tramsparent"><embed src="http://www.youtube.com/v/xbVtMY-svzA" type="application/x-shockwave-flash" wmode="transparent" width="425" height="350"></embed></object>  <br />Transformers<br /><br /><object width="425" height="350"><param name="movie" value="http://www.youtube.com/v/RsIG8-Zk_cE"></param><param name="wmode" value="tramsparent"><embed src="http://www.youtube.com/v/RsIG8-Zk_cE" type="application/x-shockwave-flash" wmode="transparent" width="425" height="350"></embed></object><br />The Bourne Ultimatum<br /><br /><br /><br /></div>
